  "description": "Park Si-on has the body of a 29-year-old and the mind of a 9-year-old; he is a savant who is on the autism spectrum. With his innate genius like two sides of the same coin, he enters a university hospital as a pediatric surgery resident. The prejudice of being a doctor with autism and the battle for power in the hospital gets more and more dangerous...! Will he ever be able to become a real doctor?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
